<p>Apply for student aid for next school year.</p><h1>Complete Your 2027-28 Aid Form Today</h1><p>Test, you can now submit your 2027-28 Free Application for Student Aid form. If you're attending college or career/trade school next year, fill out your aid form early.</p><p><a href="https://aid.example.gov/form/start">Complete Your Aid Form</a></p><p>Remember: You must submit an aid form every year you're in school.</p>
